{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"I was born on the boat that brought Kairo here 30 years ago. Teiktahe was my mentor and teacher, and I have learned everything I know about my people from him, and much that I know about the world as well. I have spent my life studying at the British Museum and occasionally going on field trips.","created_at":"2020-07-22T08:52:28.364000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735418980453449759","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
